    "response = generate('gemma2:2b', 'Explain the process of photosynthesis.', stream=True)\n",
    "\n",
    "for part in response:\n",
    "  print(part['response'], end='', flush=True)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "utyVRlIYFvdm"
   },
   "source": [
    "#### 非同步客戶端\n",
    "\n",
    "若要發出非同步請求，請使用 `AsyncClient` 類別。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
